WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The harmony is gone... The Order is broken... Locus... Is no longer needed...

2
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
To become perfect, you say?

3
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Oh... I stepped on a perfectness!

4
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Hey, what's going on?

5
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Locus is destroying itself! Run!

6
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Go, go!

7
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Oh... may the Light save us. Now, when everything's over...

8
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.500
Nothing is over.

9
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:02.500
Look around!

10
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.500
Great Tensess...

11
00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:19.500
Unbelievable...

14
00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:37.500
This is funny. If you destroy me, you will destroy your way back home.

15
00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:46.500
I have fulfilled our agreement. You interrupted the Passage, but you cannot defeat the Architect.

16
00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:55.500
Go away. Go back. Remember, children of chaos: the Order is impregnable!
